        {
          "text": " Naiyapoo ijo aiyaposit mama ejai Edeke sirikitilor aitodol; naarai mam isiyalamikini ibaŋiok: kitodolonokini nun nuiyapoi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.4",
