              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Karaida ianyuni lukican emwanitai, ido etube ka abeit da edemario kagogon kotoma obuku, sirikiwumok akirotnin: naarai loitelekarit apolou eseseni lokapolou, ejaas da lukapolou aitelekarit kes. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
