          "text": "Ejijim ajo nuka lokeswaman, arai enyami luikidioko arai luipu; konye aimonut naka ekabaran mam isiikini ŋes ajo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
