          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ido ninitunanan kere yenijaikinit Edeke abar ka iboro, ido ijaikinit apedor ainyam ka alemunun da akekorakinet, ka aisiyalamikin aitaaritoike; nin ŋes ainakinet naka Edeke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
